The scripts in this repository are derived from the approach taken by
Wanderson M. Pimenta's `blender_for_android` (https://github.com/Wanderson-Magalhaes/blender_for_android)
which is itself GPL-3.0 and based on Simfeo's earlier Android alpha
(https://github.com/simfeo/blender).
